#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-beastf7AIO.rst:70
#: 74cab8fea5a44e6eb5e92ab0a6de1b81
msgid "Arming and operation in ACRO and STABILIZE modes is possible. It is also possible to arm and fly in ALTHOLD, but altitude hold performance relies on accelerometer/gyro exclusively and could be exceptionally poor, even resulting in a crash so is not recommended. As with Plane you can use a GPS for altitude data, but Rangefinders and Beacons can also be used and the ``EK3_SCRX_POSZ`` parameters set appropriately."
msgstr ""

